{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AdaRender\/documentation\/AdaRender","doc:\/\/AdaRender\/documentation\/AdaRender\/BlendOperation"]]},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"subtract"}],"roleHeading":"Case","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"AdaRender"}],"title":"BlendOperation.subtract","symbolKind":"case","externalID":"s:9AdaRender14BlendOperationO8subtractyA2CmF"},"abstract":[{"text":"Subtract a portion of the destination pixel values from a portion of the source.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"subtract"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"RGB = Source.rgb * SBF - Dest.rgb * DBF","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A = Source.a * SBF - Dest.a * DBF","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/adarender\/blendoperation\/subtract"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AdaRender\/documentation\/AdaRender\/BlendOperation\/subtract"},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://AdaRender/documentation/AdaRender":{"title":"AdaRender","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaRender\/documentation\/AdaRender","abstract":[],"role":"collection","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/adarender"},"doc://AdaRender/documentation/AdaRender/BlendOperation/subtract":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaRender\/documentation\/AdaRender\/BlendOperation\/subtract","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"subtract","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"BlendOperation.subtract","url":"\/documentation\/adarender\/blendoperation\/subtract","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Subtract a portion of the destination pixel values from a portion of the source."}]},"doc://AdaRender/documentation/AdaRender/BlendOperation":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"For every pixel, "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaRender\/documentation\/AdaRender\/BlendOperation","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" determines how to combine and weight the source fragment values with the destination values."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Some blend operations multiply the source values by a source blend factor (SBF),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"multiply the destination values by a destination blend factor (DBF), and then combine the results using addition or subtraction."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Other blend operations use either a minimum or maximum function to determine the result."}],"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BlendOperation","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"BlendOperation","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaRender\/documentation\/AdaRender\/BlendOperation","role":"symbol","title":"BlendOperation","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/adarender\/blendoperation"}}}